		<title>Has the Dollar Rally Stalled, or Is It Already Waiting for the Midterms?</title>
		<link>https://www.actionforex.com/action-insight/market-overview/weekly-report/657142-has-the-dollar-rally-stalled-or-is-it-already-waiting-for-the-midterms/</link>
		
