<p>EUR/USD edged lower to 1.1159 last week and breached 100% projection of 1.1848 to 1.1323 from 1.1710 at 1.1185, then turned sideway. Initial bias remains neutral this week and further decline is expected. Below 1.1159 will extend the fall from 1.1710 to 161.8% projection at 1.0861. Nevertheless, break of 1.1284 minor resistance will turn bias [&#8230;]</p>
