<p>USD/JPY continued to stay in sideway trading last week. Initial bias remains neutral this week and further rise is mildly in favor as long as 156.36 support holds. Above 159.02 will extend the rebound from 152.87 to 160.38 key structural resistance next. Nevertheless, break of 156.36 will bring deeper fall back to 152.87 support instead. [&#8230;]</p>
